     1,
     "Dear list members,<div><br></div><div>I am confused about stat_smooth, even reading the documentation.</div><div><br></div><div>When doing stat_smooth, the error band or strip is a prediction interval or a confidence interval at level 0.95?</div>\r\n<div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div><br></div><div>Manuel<br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><b>Manuel Spínola, Ph.D.</b>\r\n      <br>\r\n      Instituto Internacional en Conservación y Manejo de Vida Silvestre\r\n      <br>\r\n      Universidad Nacional\r\n      <br>\r\n      Apartado 1350-3000\r\n      <br>\r\n      Heredia\r\n      <br>\r\n      COSTA RICA\r\n      <br>\r\n      <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mspi...@una.ac.cr</a>\r\n      <br>\r\n      <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mspin...@gmail.com</a>\r\n      <br>\r\n      Teléfono: (506) 2277-3598\r\n      <br>\r\n      Fax: (506) 2237-7036\r\n      <br>\r\n      Personal website: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/lobitoderio/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sites.google.com/site/lobitoderio/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792374276296000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2-q7QaOQhM-CtPiueog0bt\">Lobito de río</a>\r\n      <br>\r\n      Institutional website: <a href=\"http://www.icomvis.una.ac.cr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.icomvis.una.ac.cr/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792374276296000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Ksx34tkdGwnRJKHxJggbI\">ICOMVIS</a><br>\r\n</div>\r\n"
